# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SmartCanteen — .dockerignore  (Day 9: keep the image lean & secret-free)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Anything listed here is NOT copied into the Docker image. This
#  matters for two reasons:
#    1. Size — venv/ and __pycache__/ are huge and useless inside the
#       container (we pip install fresh anyway).
#    2. Security — .env contains the real SECRET_KEY & MONGO_URI. If it
#       gets baked into an image layer it can be extracted later.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ---- Secrets & local config (NEVER bake into an image) ----
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ---- Python caches & virtualenvs (recreated inside the image) ----
venv/
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ---- Version control & editor junk ----
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---- OS junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Logs & temp ----
*.log
*.pid

# ---- Tests don't belong in the runtime image ----
test_socket.py
